{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you ready to start collecting new and adorable creatures?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>+30</i></strong><i> different creatures</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4</strong> different seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day and night cycle:</strong> Day lasts 2 minutes, and night lasts 10 seconds (Cinematic)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture creatures by dragging them with the <strong>click</strong> and bringing them inside the farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic:</strong> You control everything with your <strong>mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visitors will <strong>react</strong> every time they see a creature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uded1 <strong>STOP</strong> <i>the unruly creatures</i><br>\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Bring order to your ranch!</strong> Click on the <strong>rowdy creatures</strong> so they <strong>stop fighting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560280/extras/Castigar.gif?t=1742652793\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2757 <strong>Don't let them escape!</strong><br>\ud83d\udc3e If a creature is <strong>loose</strong>, <strong>visitors panic.</strong> <i>Capture it before it causes a disaster!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560280/extras/Capturar-_Steam.gif?t=1742652793\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270b <strong>TAKE CONTROL!</strong><br>\ud83d\udc37 Grab a creature <strong>in time</strong> <strong>before it becomes a feast!</strong> Hold the <i>click</i> to free the visitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt